                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "genuinely the best cautionary tale about overambition i've ever seen and it was completely on accident.  kept finding new and inventive ways to frustrate me at every turn. the combat and puzzles are draining and not fun to deal with. sometimes there's the shadow of a good character but the writing isn't good enough to capitalise on it. nearly every sprite in this game clashes with every other sprite. it's just all a bunch of horseradish piled on top of horseradish.\r\n\r\nthis game wants SO badly to change your life forever but instead feels like it's just reheating the nachos of other better pieces of media. the racism doesn't help either",
